#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:15
msgid "Blogwatcher"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:17
msgid ""
"Track blog and RSS/Atom feed updates with the `blogwatcher-cli` tool. "
"Supports automatic feed discovery, HTML scraping fallback, OPML import, "
"and read/unread article management."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:19
msgid "Installation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:21
msgid "Pick one method:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:23
msgid ""
"**Go:** `go install github.com/JulienTant/blogwatcher-cli/cmd"
"/blogwatcher-cli@latest`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:24
msgid ""
"**Docker:** `docker run --rm -v blogwatcher-cli:/data ghcr.io/julientant"
"/blogwatcher-cli`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:25
msgid ""
"**Binary (Linux amd64):** `curl -sL https://github.com/JulienTant"
"/blogwatcher-cli/releases/latest/download/blogwatcher-"
"cli_linux_amd64.tar.gz | tar xz -C /usr/local/bin blogwatcher-cli`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:26
msgid ""
"**Binary (Linux arm64):** `curl -sL https://github.com/JulienTant"
"/blogwatcher-cli/releases/latest/download/blogwatcher-"
"cli_linux_arm64.tar.gz | tar xz -C /usr/local/bin blogwatcher-cli`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:27
msgid ""
"**Binary (macOS Apple Silicon):** `curl -sL https://github.com/JulienTant"
"/blogwatcher-cli/releases/latest/download/blogwatcher-"
"cli_darwin_arm64.tar.gz | tar xz -C /usr/local/bin blogwatcher-cli`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:28
msgid ""
"**Binary (macOS Intel):** `curl -sL https://github.com/JulienTant"
"/blogwatcher-cli/releases/latest/download/blogwatcher-"
"cli_darwin_amd64.tar.gz | tar xz -C /usr/local/bin blogwatcher-cli`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:30
msgid "All releases: https://github.com/JulienTant/blogwatcher-cli/releases"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:32
msgid "Docker with persistent storage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:34
