#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:129
msgid "Notes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:131
msgid ""
"Auto-discovers RSS/Atom feeds from blog homepages when no `--feed-url` is"
" provided."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:132
msgid ""
"Falls back to HTML scraping if RSS fails and `--scrape-selector` is "
"configured."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:133
msgid ""
"Categories from RSS/Atom feeds are stored and can be used to filter "
"articles."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blogwatcher_SKILL.md:134
msgid ""
"Import blogs in bulk from OPML files exported by Feedly, Inoreader, "
"NewsBlur, etc."
msgstr ""

